      <h2 class="display">A different <em>way of listening.</em></h2>
      <div class="bio">
        <p>I'm an animal communicator and intuitive channeler. I connect with animals who share your life, animals who have crossed over, and the guidance you're seeking for yourself.</p>
        <p><strong>With animals,</strong> communication comes through in images, feelings, words and sometimes the smallest, most unexpected details. I share what I receive as it comes, without trying to interpret it into something else. Before a reading, I ask for just three things: a photo, your animal's name and their species. I intentionally leave out their history, symptoms and anything you think might be going on, so those details don't influence what I receive.</p>
        <p><strong>With people,</strong> I connect with your higher self and guides, as well as my own, to explore the questions you bring and whatever else comes through for your highest good. Sometimes I work in trance. Other times I stay fully present and share the images, impressions and messages as they arrive. My approach is compassionate but straightforward. I don't reshape what comes through to make it more comfortable or to fit an expected answer.</p>
        <p>I trained through The Pet Psychic Academy, and I share my home with animals of my own, including a Doberman.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
